  "translation": "“Ahemfi adwumfoɔ ne ɔhene amantam nnipa nyinaa nim sɛ, ɔbarima anaa ɔbea biara a ɔbɛkɔ ɔhene nkyɛn, mu aporɔbɔ no mu, a wɔannfrɛ no — mmarara baako na ɛwɔ hɔ sɛ wɔnkum no; ɔno nko ara a ɔhene bɛtrɛw sika kɔkɔɔ pɛsoɔ no ama na ɔnya nkwa. Na me de, wɔammfrɛ me na memmɛkɔ ɔhene nkyɛn bɛyɛ nnasa alignSelf nnawɔtwe aduasa no.”",
